# LF everywhere (§C12); Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf otherwise break prettier and shell scripts.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary

# Mistake log: keep both sides of a merge. `check` (make lint) flags anything a merge doubled, and
# `python scripts/check-mistakes-log.py sync` rebuilds the generated tables from the traces.
Mistake_Learn.md merge=union
Mistake_Traces.md merge=union
Mistake_Traces_archive/*.md merge=union
